# Curated workstation package set — deliberately minimal, NOT a dump of any one
# machine. Add packages here (then `brew bundle --global`) instead of ad-hoc
# `brew install`, so every Mac stays reproducible from this file.
# Deployed by homedir-manager; `brew bundle --global` finds it via
# HOMEBREW_BUNDLE_FILE_GLOBAL (set in .zshenv — XDG_CONFIG_HOME is unset here).

